    "summary": "Adopt through a thin optional installer adapter, with explicit version pinning and an internal provenance record. Prefer its existing ecosystem reach over rebuilding every directory convention. Add compatibility probes and rollback around activation. Do not automatically install every search result or activate every installed skill. Evaluate source changes, dependencies, scripts, and trigger behavior before promoting an update.",
