    "topics": [
      "skills",
      "agents",
      "evolution"
    ],
    "depth": "source-reviewed",
    "summary": "Borrow the canonical intermediate representation and compatibility diagnostics, and evaluate SkillKit as an optional management UI/CLI integration. Do not make a large third-party skill-management platform the sole source of truth. Require trigger tests, forbidden-action tests, and representative output checks per supported model/harness tuple. Especially test that an apparently successful translation with incompatible hooks cannot silently pass the team's release gate.",
    "word_count": 324
  },
  {
