    "summary": "Adopt as an experimental decision and memory pattern, not as a dependency or a general SOTA result. Build a small controlled study comparing direct tool use against hypothesis/backtest/planning on representative tasks. Include held-out transitions, explicit compute accounting, and adversarial counterexamples. Preserve simulator uncertainty and fall back to direct observation when predictions fail. Do not imply the website contains deployable harness source or that near-ceiling public-game performance transfers to team coding work.",
